    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/f70d3491b01783e090c20560c59100c7.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/c1ccc2a3b2ad9638b85b1bcb1333e596.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/a32eceae8e7cc711d067118342d163b2.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, chase the Moon, and adapt to changing wind patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silhouette platformer with dynamic wind system that pushes against you or with you in different ways at varied intervals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 3 Game Modes:<br>-Linear Mode with 100 Levels consisting of various psychics based obstacles which change in theme every 10 Stages<br>-Random Mode where each level is randomized in theme and obstacles<br>-Legend Mode starts with 100 Linear stages and progresses into randomized stages after completing the 100th stage\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode loops infinitely.<br><br>As the wind pushes against you and changes direction, see how far you can run and how many stages you can finish before you fail.<br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/f70d3491b01783e090c20560c59100c7.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/c1ccc2a3b2ad9638b85b1bcb1333e596.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292170/extras/a32eceae8e7cc711d067118342d163b2.avif?t=1754446989\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, chase the Moon, and adapt to changing wind patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silhouette platformer with dynamic wind system that pushes against you or with you in different ways at varied intervals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 3 Game Modes:<br>-Linear Mode with 100 Levels consisting of various psychics based obstacles which change in theme every 10 Stages<br>-Random Mode where each level is randomized in theme and obstacles<br>-Legend Mode starts with 100 Linear stages and progresses into randomized stages after completing the 100th stage\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode loops infinitely.<br><br>As the wind pushes against you and changes direction, see how far you can run and how many stages you can finish before you fail.<br></p>",
    "short_description": "Resist the wind and chase the Moon.",
